# BAS width subtyping: record with extra field satisfies annotation with fewer fields.
# [@[type: [x: Int] default: [x: 5]] [x: 1  y: 2]]
# Under BAS, {x:1, y:2} <: {x: Int} (width subtyping), so the assertion PASSES and
# the default is NOT used. The full dict including the extra field is returned.
[@[type: [x: Int]  default: [x: 5]] [x: 1  y: 2]]
=== out
Dict({"x": Int(1), "y": Int(2)})
